  "id": "collaboration",
  "term": "collaboration",
  "definition": "In learning contexts, collaboration is the process of learners working together through structured interaction to support shared cognitive, social, and emotional development. Its quality depends on how participation and regulation are organized, since problems like free-riding or unequal involvement can weaken its effectiveness.",
